      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on some brand identity decks for a new luxury house. We're trying to differentiate between two very different target demographics for our upcoming collections. Can you help me sketch out the vibe for both? \n\nI need a detailed aesthetic/lifestyle profile for:\n1. The 'Old Money/High-Class' consumer (think heritage, quiet luxury, understated elegance).\n2. The 'Urban/Mass-Market' consumer (think trendy, high-energy, streetwear-influenced, fast-paced).\n\nJust basically what kind of lifestyle, environments, and 'look' defines each one so my design team has a clear direction. Thanks!",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
